%% Drift → retrain → quality gate → promote / keep / rollback → hot reload (Airflow DAGs drift_monitoring + model_retrain)
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant SCH as Airflow<br/>drift_monitoring<br/>(*/30 phút)
    participant DM as Drift Monitor<br/>(Evidently)
    participant PG as PostgreSQL<br/>inference_logs
    participant RT as Airflow<br/>model_retrain
    participant TR as credit_risk.training<br/>(retrain + gate)
    participant MR as MLflow Registry<br/>+ MinIO
    participant API as Scoring API
    participant AL as statsd → Prometheus<br/>→ Alertmanager
    participant OC as Telegram /<br/>alert-webhook

    SCH->>DM: POST /analyze {window_size: 500}
    DM->>PG: SELECT 500 log mới nhất
    alt < 50 mẫu hoặc DB down
        DM-->>SCH: status=skipped (không fail DAG)
    else đủ mẫu
        DM->>DM: PSI key features + Evidently drift share + prediction PSI
        DM-->>AL: credit_drift_* gauges (scrape /metrics)
        DM-->>SCH: is_drifted, drift_share, top PSI, report
    end

    alt không drift
        SCH->>SCH: no_drift (kết thúc)
    else chỉ prediction shift (PSI ≥ 0.25, input không drift)
        SCH->>OC: [DRIFT] Prediction distribution shift → điều tra model, KHÔNG retrain
    else dataset drift
        SCH->>OC: [DRIFT] Data drift detected + top PSI + link report
        SCH->>SCH: check_retrain_cooldown (60 phút, không có run đang chạy)
        SCH->>RT: TriggerDagRun(reason="drift_monitoring <run_id>")
    end

    RT->>TR: train_challenger (external python)
    TR->>MR: đọc @champion hiện tại (vN)
    TR->>TR: fit challenger: replay 15k baseline + 5k feedback, cùng thuật toán + params champion
    TR->>TR: chấm challenger và champion trên CÙNG held-out drifted rows
    TR->>MR: log run + register vN+1 alias @challenger (lineage tags, gate_reasons)
    TR-->>RT: metrics challenger / champion + gate decision

    RT->>RT: quality_gate: ROC-AUC ≥ min_roc_auc (0.70)?
    alt dưới floor (demo: make retrain-fail, floor 0.99)
        RT-->>AL: credit_retrain_last_run_failed = 1
        AL->>OC: RetrainFailed (critical) - champion vN giữ nguyên
    else qua floor
        RT->>RT: decide_promotion (non-inferior ROC-AUC, expected loss không tệ hơn, có cải thiện)
        alt gate = keep
            RT->>OC: [RETRAIN] challenger vN+1 rejected - champion vN kept (+ lý do)
        else gate = promote
            RT->>MR: promote_champion: @champion → vN+1 (ghi previous_champion)
            RT->>API: POST /api/v1/model/reload (X-API-Key)
            API->>MR: load models:/credit-risk-model@champion
            API->>API: swap snapshot atomic (request đang chạy không bị gián đoạn)
            API-->>RT: status=reloaded, model_version=vN+1, degraded=false
            alt API không phục vụ vN+1 (reload lỗi / sai version / degraded)
                RT->>MR: rollback_champion: @champion → vN
                RT->>API: POST /api/v1/model/reload
                RT-->>AL: credit_retrain_last_run_failed = 1
                AL->>OC: RetrainFailed - đã rollback về vN
            else đúng vN+1
                RT->>DM: POST /reference/refresh (re-score reference bằng champion mới)
                RT-->>AL: last_run_failed = 0, last_promoted_version = N+1
                RT->>OC: [RETRAIN] vN+1 promoted: ROC-AUC, F1, financial loss trước/sau
            end
        end
    end
